{"title":"1995 AJHSME Problems/Problem 16","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Students from three middle schools worked on a summer project.\n</p>\n<ul><li>Seven students from Allen school worked for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> days.</li>\n<li>Four students from Balboa school worked for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> days.</li>\n<li>Five students from Carver school worked for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> days.</li></ul>\n<p>The total amount paid for the students' work was <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/1/1b161fc4956b519c3a89a3b01134ac49c09990c2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$774$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"38\" height=\"16\" />.  Assuming each student received the same amount for a day's work, how much did the students from Balboa school earn altogether?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/b/b7bd7cb1a5abb00f5cd940e11a829b94e600f041.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\$9.00 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ \\$48.38 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ \\$180.00 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\$193.50 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\$258.00$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"576\" height=\"19\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The students combined for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/4/2a42f7406e4215e12cf6e9cbad3d89bf45397001.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7\\cdot 3 + 4 \\cdot 5 + 5 \\cdot 9 = 86$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"183\" height=\"15\" /> student workdays.  Therefore, each student earned <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/b/16b6151ba5a127a397274ace18ec01279d80b59c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$774 \\div 86 = \\$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"121\" height=\"17\" /> per workday.  Since the Balboa students completed <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/7/c47fdae2d201b1a7f51ca66646dabc8acf0ab832.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 \\cdot 4 = 20$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"73\" height=\"13\" /> workdays, they earned a total of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/b/7cb95f22c25966ba8aa3f64dbaedb59d69855bbe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20 \\cdot \\$9 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\$180.00}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"181\" height=\"31\" />. \n</p><p>~edited by zhenyi, j314andrews\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME\" title=\"